message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "autoqec-sim: vectorized stabilizer-code reward engine and RL environment"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "TBD"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/unitaryfoundation/autoqec-sim"
authors:
  - family-names: Russo
    given-names: Vincent
keywords:
  - quantum error correction
  - stabilizer codes
  - reinforcement learning
  - Clifford simulation
abstract: >-
  Batched Aaronson-Gottesman tableau simulator, Knill-Laflamme reward,
  connectivity-restricted RL environment with an LDPC sparsity constraint,
  circuit-level noise reward through the autoqec_sim.noise package, and the
  Steane, surface-code, and [[5,1,3]] rediscovery regressions with
  evolutionary search and PPO.
